WEBVTT

08:31.120 --> 08:33.790
there are times you make me wonder
whose side you're on.

08:33.915 --> 08:36.042
My dear brother, you wound me.

08:36.167 --> 08:38.628
You know how much
I love my family.

08:58.064 --> 08:59.190
Please.

08:59.315 --> 09:02.610
Oh, I would have dressed, Your Grace.
